#: scenario7:scenario7_99EEECE2_ECCA_47E9_9341_77F7239EB190
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3d09776b985607a6e18f941c01a99bb4a76f2de9b85ace8495e4ee0fd4981b8f
#. default-sha256: 87590f6d66319a3ec7b41abbfb3b6f7e339c13810622720f4532389ff0de8ac8
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_99EEECE2_ECCA_47E9_9341_77F7239EB190"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Sitting in the carriage waiting outside, "
"listening to the ⟪k:11⟫pitter patter⟪k:12⟫ of the rain, I gazed out at my two brothers."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫兄二人が用意した馬車に乗って――⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫"
"雷雨の中、⟪k:13⟫見送る二人の顔を見た。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_10D7A1F4_5DCA_408C_ABC8_640CB5DF83DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ce3148a48deeed9a70fa9d1237379c3f4e853f1523e3f36e2aa011e528f9fc9
#. default-sha256: bdabb0744530478973a61c3356721bd894fdf29a8ee7e9eb26955fb5a7031e80
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_10D7A1F4_5DCA_408C_ABC8_640CB5DF83DD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I hadn’t seen them in two years, but they hardly looked any different than how I remembered "
"them."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫二年ぶりに見た彼らの顔は、⟪k:1⟫何ひとつ変わっていなかった。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_2EA95ABB_F168_436E_B99F_3AC93C2BA29A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b98e08d382301551b9902ef2c85f84e4c3960f3935776d201d6b2f58a65aac7f
#. default-sha256: c3067c1179f870c0dc54d251fca786d120ff1abe3f68faa3fdc9fe61ed63d153
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2EA95ABB_F168_436E_B99F_3AC93C2BA29A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was the only one who had changed—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and dramatically, at that."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私だけが、⟪k:1⟫大きすぎる変貌を遂げたのだ。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_0692BDB2_6F38_4DA8_96DC_2DB7EF2CF8FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 070341c5e7cece4fb3ee49bee170c831d4f0ed596f1e6c3fd5307bcdac457aa7
#. default-sha256: 9dd3cbdafeb86e46212886c675c55fb308e3233b9dcac477cdfaad01540a2c99
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0692BDB2_6F38_4DA8_96DC_2DB7EF2CF8FF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫…………。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_DCE13B0D_57E6_4B52_AB7E_7C8D7DD09A97
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9f8c67f5569c547c13e463d98208f7f837e0bb97c9a998a0925890b8aaeae6e9
#. default-sha256: 1dd413729a7b87bb5faad8649356ec2690a68a49ea56c050677c0d3f39b91510
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DCE13B0D_57E6_4B52_AB7E_7C8D7DD09A97"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Looking at them, I couldn’t help but remember the old days.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Playing chess with "
"Didier. Learning to draw from Georges."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫二人の顔を見ると、⟪k:1⟫どうしても過去のことが思い出される。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ディディエと打ったチェ"
"ス、⟪k:4⟫ジョルジュに教えられた絵……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_8D7B438A_C041_426F_B20E_4A9733C9449D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6b24bdc250b0a422282be767580a24f5a69a022594e487d02d560f0189767397
#. default-sha256: 9f29e6853a77828e6eb9cd2cd67e5fa2fcccd79d0660174c37cdaeec0ac7d75c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8D7B438A_C041_426F_B20E_4A9733C9449D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Our sibling outings."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それから、⟪k:1⟫三人で出かけた記憶。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_D803BB77_22AB_475F_8509_A45EEB5F5B91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8ff1da1ce50eb617c8da6536bce2b35ae212438dd55f363fca31a4fc79abe5b8
#. default-sha256: 33e383bd2bf24930cca699bda4924ec3a2a89ca89d3fab96b35e7e1163918b38
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D803BB77_22AB_475F_8509_A45EEB5F5B91"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, the ominous sound of thunder crashing in the distance drowned out those memories."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫――けれど雷鳴の轟く夜の庭は、⟪k:1⟫それらの優しい日々を塗り潰していくかのように、⟪k:2⟫不吉だっ"
"た。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_FCE8D84B_D01C_402F_B4D3_4CC436757271
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 093771d7098a85ec2c417bab8d08507fcaf5745596b645f2adf1feee95323ad2
#. default-sha256: 8290df63ac32b2244a1c908961120e65adb9e23845230fa58f8073f2e7a08740
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FCE8D84B_D01C_402F_B4D3_4CC436757271"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The mansion is several days’ travel from here.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Hopefully the carriage "
"isn’t too uncomfortable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫屋敷は、⟪k:3⟫ここから暫くの距離がある。⟪k:4⟫数日の間は馬車で過ごしてもらわねばなら"
"ぬが、⟪k:5⟫辛抱してくれ。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_89F3AA26_DF35_434A_8F40_DF2869E9AD99
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a9e3ca6949ac7f06b5b72c6c504e6ffe81ed09968dc932ce51ccd3cedabb693f
#. default-sha256: d570a87ac64e27792617c330700d19bc580c3aa6d1be9206c4e9ce93bf46452a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_89F3AA26_DF35_434A_8F40_DF2869E9AD99"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_A9D99D4E_35D3_4074_9B0A_7E5A3AC6A97B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe746057d4af6976a1a21c74eb3651b7c3f4b47ecd8e5a29051036a341bec31e
#. default-sha256: b491d6b6c80cc0f53dc8d3f79a3b9ce7063663189ddfda3a6f7a8b71db02c676
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A9D99D4E_35D3_4074_9B0A_7E5A3AC6A97B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I will send a package with any supplies you need once a month.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Food, "
"clothing... ⟪k:4⟫and, ⟪k:5⟫hmm, ⟪k:6⟫something to pass the time..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫必要な物資は、⟪k:2⟫月に一度、⟪k:3⟫こちらから送る。⟪k:4⟫食料だとか、⟪k:5⟫衣服だとか"
"⟪k:6⟫……後はそうだな、⟪k:7⟫何か時間を潰せるものを……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_EB5FBF65_86D4_4B41_92C9_567FADCDC9CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a9e3ca6949ac7f06b5b72c6c504e6ffe81ed09968dc932ce51ccd3cedabb693f
#. default-sha256: d570a87ac64e27792617c330700d19bc580c3aa6d1be9206c4e9ce93bf46452a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_EB5FBF65_86D4_4B41_92C9_567FADCDC9CC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_4077FCB7_CA33_461C_927B_AF968C0A6F3F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c4026535a130c1fb88ae398c479f24a90f953fba81846afb37c74c8ae79fe689
#. default-sha256: 884613bb09770736936dbe26d04fc6bfc4a69f3b3bf3841a8c915232cdb4d32d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4077FCB7_CA33_461C_927B_AF968C0A6F3F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫If there’s anything you want, Michel, just tell me.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Now, ⟪k:4⟫or you can have "
"a servant pass a message on to me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ミシェル……、⟪k:2⟫もし欲しいものがあったら、⟪k:3⟫言ってくれて構わん。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫今でも良い"
"し、⟪k:6⟫後で使用人を介するのでも。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_C2CEF67B_A24F_4EBC_8DC2_CE4EC03D5CB3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b212113b1a75b9d01ac82e1fbbc31da03257e4b2b704dd66423771405d9156bf
#. default-sha256: f0b0e6f8be56b1452eec98b61aa0196f685779c7e423dac0306bd8fca25f2512
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C2CEF67B_A24F_4EBC_8DC2_CE4EC03D5CB3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I can’t think of— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Actually, ⟪k:4⟫wait, ⟪k:5⟫I ⟪k:6⟫can⟪k:7⟫ think of one "
"thing.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫I would like a chess set..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……特には……、⟪k:2⟫……いや、⟪k:3⟫そう……ですね。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫チェス盤を――もらえたら……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_505C1968_149F_4518_99EF_C72F7BA41284
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7fa7b321fd9caff19a32699b991fc01cd61f4458d0d6333a0278bf5c0d72c780
#. default-sha256: 3fd4d38fce81a9c082f37461b7bfd146e9fbe0f9f9d31ab1d86e8b4cdbfb2c8b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_505C1968_149F_4518_99EF_C72F7BA41284"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫All right. I’ll have one made—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ああ、⟪k:2⟫それならば職人に新しいものを作らせ――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_A699E8CB_FB72_4F79_8085_CB554C20E25D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ac9407b3bea8045d203913e50ee0e6780da1034ad65c98c2f4d41c7e931f064a
#. default-sha256: dd124eb7a5db7d985fab23969c63c5deb203316ec6252ed92672ab1f0e2dab89
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A699E8CB_FB72_4F79_8085_CB554C20E25D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I would rather have... ⟪k:2⟫yours, Didier.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Would that be possible...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ディディエ兄さんの使っていたチェス盤が……欲しいんです。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫駄目ですか……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_41BD96CA_D881_46D5_A6B2_B6C97E613885
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a2d1f86cf4eb07fb853877c08e33b4244f0670c8f650351962cacc05c7c61d4
#. default-sha256: 83a0aa99d81d67b647c14cc68953804e819ece75fe0815a8dde218c82b88615c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_41BD96CA_D881_46D5_A6B2_B6C97E613885"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Are you sure you want that beaten old thing?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……あれはもう古いし、⟪k:2⟫傷も目立つが……良いのか？"

#: scenario7:scenario7_C6A44EC2_D2EC_4509_8D70_4310041CC0E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a7e3c6f0abddeec7db3a992b26d482dbcde761be4902fba4fb8acb6c50cc93b
#. default-sha256: 922e62e27c6ed7bee1d9f37f27325ed5582ca2319184d36be9581274d20d268a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C6A44EC2_D2EC_4509_8D70_4310041CC0E2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...Yes, I want that one."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫………それが、⟪k:2⟫良いのです。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_77193580_493C_4B1C_B164_DF42D5A5400F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eff1d7c736f4b9920aaf0c1ff66212a090632281413bfb757de58e43ecf5c6b7
#. default-sha256: 22793610e25d9fae6e20b6a9815e4908c4d02e6ce3649e5add6b640fcff98eb4
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_77193580_493C_4B1C_B164_DF42D5A5400F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...All right, then. I’ll include it in the first delivery."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……そうか。⟪k:2⟫分かった、⟪k:3⟫では初めの物資に入れておこう。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_FD276F4D_E5F0_4568_95EC_1F7EC24345C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f5063d307bcdf14ec4dc484d45d1ab1eb16ce987448f3130a79564b1bf8f0636
#. default-sha256: 6e65c226e9cc87cdb61bc6287df3b16613ebacc22f4d9aa9080121ac6dc028e1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FD276F4D_E5F0_4568_95EC_1F7EC24345C0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I’ll send you something too, Michel.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Anything you want, just tell me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ねえミシェル、⟪k:4⟫ぼくからも何か送るよ。⟪k:5⟫何がいい？⟪k:6⟫　言ってみて。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_AC12B8FE_305D_44C1_8A8C_2B831305A787
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80bb38596d679547e8813a5f6289f9f441c62fc7edc4d1a47fcf050d1a637bda
#. default-sha256: c0c57d7ec7c6d7d31a1bdaa628df9b46c05c0aff215c91f896f916666a53df99
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_AC12B8FE_305D_44C1_8A8C_2B831305A787"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫In that case... ⟪k:5⟫I would like some art tools.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"I’m nowhere near as much of an artist as you are,⟪k:8⟫Georges, so they don’t have to be anything "
"special."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫じゃあ、⟪k:4⟫絵を描く道具を……。⟪k:5⟫兄さんのように絵が描けるわけではない"
"から……簡単なものでいいです。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_6B063F2C_3FEE_4909_821D_945E81EB97D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2320ff2a8434a20412bb1c557072bc0cc106cc1e802d30563a904abbb9ead9bd
#. default-sha256: b469c9be6739b27a312a7f8d6ae7a7c357481bccadefd7d9a08ba7853a4964b3
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6B063F2C_3FEE_4909_821D_945E81EB97D4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Gotcha. So some canvas and, ⟪k:2⟫hmm... ⟪k:3⟫how ’bout some charcoal?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫And when "
"you’re back, I want to see what you’ve made with it, okay?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫そっか、⟪k:2⟫じゃあキャンパスになるものと……木炭かな。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫何か描いたら――ミシェルが"
"戻ってきたときでいいから、⟪k:5⟫見せてね。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_773BFE2C_EEBA_4DAA_89F6_C6732E4E9AA9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6119c9c70a56a656fa6c666ca67d716fa72277c498d75b579126595b310bae72
#. default-sha256: 14d491151c1bb2aec33b3814d654bdaa268462ddb7e9bb9a3249e2063233172d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_773BFE2C_EEBA_4DAA_89F6_C6732E4E9AA9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Okay."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……分かりました。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_1A34B477_352D_4260_8109_F961EDAD8409
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5f34f05294dc4a5257c1f540417397165aec69d2ea012707215d2053f39f8a5d
#. default-sha256: 5914a09edf7f7e27905481937b475f715f490d4e7ba9c9cc7524e5f65b15cf60
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1A34B477_352D_4260_8109_F961EDAD8409"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I know this is already hard enough on you, Michel...⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫but I need "
"to ask you to do something for me.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Avoid making contact with anyone who doesn’t already "
"know about you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ミシェル……、⟪k:5⟫お前には苦労を強いていると分かっているが、⟪k:6⟫ひとつ頼"
"みがある。⟪k:7⟫事情を知っている人間以外と、⟪k:8⟫極力関わらないでくれ。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_3C6A4E98_1E6E_47E0_81AE_514B9EECE399
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c6e5c46878748dc6f7a92d88380a2a2c1dd581c8c50171816d7fa1f2c40bdc31
#. default-sha256: 18fc0f63aaa50278a6d72676beb2fa83f39fe7e18bd7a5db8dc465cfabb13ea9
